    <string name="rhythm_derive_info_profile_classic_043">Writes all settings the 0.4.3-pisces.1 build used: classic single-point beat grid, Classic grid derivation, PC lane layout, up to two notes per slot, loudness and density filters off, all difficulties.\n\nThe old build’s only generation path was this fixed grid plus grid quantization. Derived from the old master, Easy reproduces the 544-note chart exactly; a newly generated master has a different grid, so its note count may differ.</string>
    <string name="rhythm_derive_info_profile_recommended">Writes the currently measured-best combination: tracked beat grid, Raw onsets derivation, melody-first selection, PC lane layout, up to two notes per slot, loudness and density filters off, all difficulties.\n\nRaw onsets never move a timestamp, so notes stay exactly on the audio. Melody first won the listening A/B tests. The filters are escape hatches for noisy material, not an improvement.</string>
    <string name="rhythm_derive_profile_summary_format">%1$s · %2$s · %3$s · %4$s · %5$s · %6$s · %7$s · %8$s</string>
    <string name="rhythm_derive_profile_summary_all">all three difficulties</string>
    <string name="rhythm_derive_profile_summary_none">—</string>
    <string name="rhythm_derive_profile_expand">Adjust</string>
